{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S08、S11、S12等短停留段仍安排了较多长句和感受行，边听边扫的阅读压力明显高于X，X的短词更容易一眼掠过。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】标出每段叙述的信息骨架，让观众不读完所有文字也能抓住人物当下的处境和转折；感受部分又具体补出了舍不得、抗拒、孤独、依恋等情绪之间的因果关系，以及音乐中细微的变化。尤其从反复怀疑、重新认识自己的需要，到最后带着想念继续生活，Y把前后变化连接得更清楚，人物也更立体。X的短词确实更容易扫读，但不少感受停留在情绪标签，观众需要自己补足它们与人物经历之间的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ff63260b-4cc3-43ea-b567-1549c23a6888", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T041527767349Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T04:16:07.437517+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "23b5af022921889041c8850d9adac0360d1865a747c68b7ce9e4f6f66399fc6a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg